## 5. Update Pipeline — Step by Step

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["Trigger: CLI / GUI / Guardian"] --> B["Phase 1: Pre-Flight & Branch Check"]
    B -->|"Not on main"| X["Abort"]
    B --> S1["Phase 1b: Pre-Update Stability Check"]
    S1 -->|"Doctor fails"| X
    S1 --> C["Phase 2: Shutdown Running Server"]
    C --> D["Phase 3: Backup Critical Files"]
    D --> E["Phase 4: Git Pull (main only)"]
    E -->|"FF fails"| Y["Restore & Abort"]
    E --> SEC["Phase 4b: Security Gates 1, 2, 4"]
    SEC -->|"PAD tampered"| Y
    SEC --> F["Phase 5: npm install"]
    F --> SEC3["Phase 5b: Security Gate 3 (npm audit)"]
    SEC3 --> G["Phase 6: Config Migration"]
    G --> H["Phase 7: Build"]
    H --> SEC2["Phase 7b: Security Gate 5 (PAD Re-Verify)"]
    SEC2 -->|"Integrity fail"| Y
    SEC2 --> I["Phase 8: DB Migrations"]
    I --> V["Phase 9: Post-Update Verification"]
    V -->|"Doctor fails"| Y2["Rollback"]
    V --> K["Phase 10: Restart Server"]
    K --> L["Phase 11: Client Auto-Refresh"]
```

### Phase 1: Pre-Flight Checks & Branch Verification

- Verify Node.js ≥ 22, npm, git on PATH.
- **Strict Main Branch Check.** Abort if not on `main`.
- Record `oldVersion` from `package.json`.

### Phase 1b: Pre-Update Stability Check

- Run `npm run doctor`. Abort if fatal issues exist pre-update.

### Phase 2: Detect & Shutdown Running Server

- Check port `PRISM_DASHBOARD_PORT` (default `7070`).
- Graceful `POST /api/system/shutdown`, then wait/force-kill.

### Phase 3: Automatic Backup

- Backup all critical files (§2.2) to `backups/pre-update-<timestamp>/`.
- Record SHA-256 hashes of governance files.

### Phase 4: Git Pull

- Stash dirty working tree if needed.
- `git pull --ff-only origin main`. Abort on conflict.
- Pop stash. Record `newVersion`.

### Phase 4b: Security Gates 1, 2, 4

- PAD integrity + governance signature verification.
- Governance file hash audit.
- Script self-modification detection.

### Phase 5: Dependency Install

- `npm install` (incremental).

### Phase 5b: Security Gate 3

- `npm audit --omit=dev --audit-level=high`.

### Phase 6: Configuration Migration

- **6a.** `.env` append-merge (new keys only).
- **6b.** `.prism-preferences.json` deep merge (add missing fields including `autoUpdate`).
- **6c.** Workspace structure via `ensureWorkspaceStructure()`.

### Phase 7: Build

- `npm run build` (includes `prebuild` PAD hash).

### Phase 7b: Security Gate 5

- `verifyDirectiveIntegrity()`. Rollback on divergence.

### Phase 8: Run DB Migrations

- `MigrationRunner` on all `*.db` files.

### Phase 9: Post-Update Verification

- `npm run doctor`. Verify `dist/` artifacts.
- Rollback on failure.

### Phase 10: Restart Server

- If server was running: respawn.
- If not: print completion message.

### Phase 11: Client Auto-Refresh

- Browser polls `/api/health` every 1.5s.
- On `200 OK` → `window.location.reload()`.

