## 8. Rollback Strategy

### 8.1 Update Rollback (Snapshot)

- Restore critical files from `backups/`.
- `git checkout .` if needed.
- DB migrations are transactional — failed migrations auto-rollback.

### 8.2 Standardized Rollback Event Schema

Both update rollbacks and runtime security rollbacks emit the same event format for unified Guardian/Operator visibility:

```json
{
  "layer": "system",
  "operation": "rollback.initiated",
  "details": {
    "source": "update",
    "phase": "post_build_verification",
    "reason": "PAD integrity divergence",
    "backupPath": "backups/pre-update-2026-07-10T18-00-00Z/",
    "filesRestored": [".env", "prism-activity.db"]
  }
}
```

