## 11. Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] `update.bat` / `npm run update` performs the full pipeline: branch check → stability check → shutdown → backup → pull → security gates → install → migrate → build → PAD verify → DB migrate → verify → restart.
- [ ] Configurations are merged/appended, never overwritten.
- [ ] Branch must be `main` or update aborts.
- [ ] PAD integrity compromise → immediate rollback.
- [ ] Guardian's `update_version_check` task autonomously detects available updates and notifies the operator.
- [ ] Auto-update checkbox in sidebar toggles `autoUpdate` preference. Auto-update only fires when no active sessions and operator is away.
- [ ] Clicking UPDATE in sidebar triggers the pipeline with confirmation dialog, overlay, and auto-refresh.
- [ ] All events emitted to Activity Bus and visible in Logs & Debug.
- [ ] Pre-update and post-update doctor checks pass.
- [ ] `npm install --ignore-scripts` + selective rebuild for supply-chain defense.
- [ ] Cross-platform: Windows, Linux, macOS.

